{"unit_id":"grelvan__dsh-ocr-local#card-zh","repo":"grelvan/dsh-ocr-local","commit":"81ba3cdaba6e7186bcf049800d635c07b317eb97","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ocr-local 是面向 DSH Web 的本地图片 OCR 插件。当会话模型明确只支持文本时，它会缓存图片并提示模型调用 ocr_image；视觉模型或能力未知时保持静默。ocr_image 用本地 PP-OCRv5 和 ONNX Runtime 识别缓存图片或指定路径图片，可返回文字及置信度。ocr_setup 可检查或准备 Python 环境、依赖与模型。适合需要文本模型读取截图、照片文字或图片中代码的用户。需 Python 和本地 OCR 依赖；首次准备会下载模型与依赖，无需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:609","dsh/index.js:614","dsh/index.js:692","dsh/capability.js:35","ocr/ocr.py:201"]}
{"unit_id":"grelvan__dsh-ocr-local#card-en","repo":"grelvan/dsh-ocr-local","commit":"81ba3cdaba6e7186bcf049800d635c07b317eb97","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ocr-local adds local OCR to DSH Web. For text-only models, it caches images and prompts the model to call ocr_image. The tool reads images with PP-OCRv5 and returns text. ocr_setup prepares Python dependencies and models; setup downloads both. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:609","dsh/index.js:614","dsh/index.js:692","dsh/capability.js:35","ocr/ocr.py:201"]}
