{"unit_id":"grelvan__dsh-ocr-local#feature-1","repo":"grelvan/dsh-ocr-local","commit":"81ba3cdaba6e7186bcf049800d635c07b317eb97","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ocr-local 的功能「本地图片文字识别」：调用 ocr_image 并提供缓存引用或图片路径后，插件使用本地 PP-OCRv5 与 ONNX Runtime 识别图片，返回文字行；可选返回行块、置信度和坐标。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:614","dsh/index.js:630","dsh/index.js:685","ocr/ocr.py:201"]}
